<response><item key="0"><transcript-id>54</transcript-id><title>For general release - Royal visit 1959</title><prime-minister>Menzies, Robert</prime-minister><period-of-service>19491219 - 19660126</period-of-service><field_date>10/03/1959</field_date><release-type>Media Release</release-type><document>https://pmtranscripts.pmc.gov.au/sites/default/files/original/00000054.pdf</document><subjects></subjects><content><![CDATA[<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">FOR GENERAL RELEASE.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">ROYAL VISIT 1959.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">The following is a list of the Commonwealth Organisation for the visit of Her Royal Highness Princess Alexandra of Kent.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Her Royal Highness will spend about 6 weeks in Australia from August 15th next, and will visit the Australian Capital Territory, Queensland (where she will spend 3 weeks), New South Wales and Victoria.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Director-General - W.R. Cumming, Esq C.V.O.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">(Already announced</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Secretary - J. Dingwall, Esp.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Public Relations Director - R. Kennedy, Esp.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Commonwealth Security Officer - R.W. Whirred, Esp., M.V.O.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Commonwealth Transport Officer - J.W. Reilly, Esq.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Postmaster-General's Department - L.A. Fincher, Esq.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Department of Civil Aviation - D.S. Graham, Esq</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Department of the Navy - Lieutenant - Commander&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">P.J. Hutson, R.A.N.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Department of the Army - Lieutenant- Colonel</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Department of Air - Wing Commander D.E. Moseley,</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">R.A.A.F.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">With the compliments of Robert Kennedy,&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">Special Assistant to the Prime Minister.</span></p>
<p style="line-height:normal;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;">CANBERRA, A.C.T.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;">10<sup>th</sup> March, 1959.</span></p>
]]></content></item></response>
